Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 18:59:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix(i18n): CJK-aware terminal width, lazy input label,
 realtime language switch

- Add display_width(), wc_ljust(), wc_center() to core.i18n for CJK alignment
- Rewrite base_menu.py header/footer/title to use CJK-aware centering
- Make input_label_txt lazy (evaluated in __post_init__ after i18n loaded)
- Rewrite main_menu.py columns to use wc_ljust() for proper CJK alignment
- Add reload_i18n() for instant language switch in settings without restart
